  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "General rule",
     "texto": [
      "Write the full **infinitive** and add **-ai, -as, -a, -ons, -ez, -ont**: **travailler** → **je travaillerai** (I'll work).",
      "With verbs ending in **-re**, drop the final **e**: **prendre** → **je prendrai** (I'll take)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Common irregular verbs",
     "texto": [
      "They change the stem, but the endings are the same: **être** → **ser-** (je serai), **avoir** → **aur-** (j'aurai), **aller** → **ir-** (j'irai), **faire** → **fer-** (je ferai)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Other common stems",
     "texto": [
      "These also change: **venir** → **viendr-** (je viendrai), **pouvoir** → **pourr-** (je pourrai) and **vouloir** → **voudr-** (je voudrai). The endings stay the same."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
